 on the future of money.</description>\n    </image>\n    <item>\n      <title>Kraken cuts 150 staff amid AI efficiencies, potentially delaying IPO: Report</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 07:14:27 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 07:14:27 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-parent-payward-cuts-150-staff-potentially-delaying-ipo-report</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-parent-payward-cuts-150-staff-potentially-delaying-ipo-report?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1rcmFrZW4taXBvLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Kraken cuts 150 staff amid AI efficiencies, potentially delaying IPO: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Kraken has cut 150 staff due to the rising use of AI, adding to more than 5,000 layoffs across the crypto sector so far this year, Bloomberg reports.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Jesse Coghlan</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1rcmFrZW4taXBvLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1rcmFrZW4taXBvLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Verus Ethereum bridge reportedly exploited for $11.6M in latest DeFi attack</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 07:11:30 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 07:11:30 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/verus-ethereum-bridge-reportedly-exploited-for-millions</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/verus-ethereum-bridge-reportedly-exploited-for-millions?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9ibG9ja2NoYWluLXRlY2hub2xvZ3ktYnJpZGdlLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Verus Ethereum bridge reportedly exploited for $11.6M in latest DeFi attack\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Two security companies have flagged the address where the stolen funds are allegedly being held, showing the cryptocurrencies have been converted into 5,402 Ether.\n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9ibG9ja2NoYWluLXRlY2hub2xvZ3ktYnJpZGdlLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9ibG9ja2NoYWluLXRlY2hub2xvZ3ktYnJpZGdlLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Surging oil prices have been driving Ether selling pressure: Tom Lee</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 07:02:06 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 07:02:06 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/surging-oil-prices-key-driver-of-eth-selling-pressure-says-tom-lee</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/surging-oil-prices-key-driver-of-eth-selling-pressure-says-tom-lee?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9vaWwtYml0Y29pbi1jb2luLWFudC1ibG9ja2NoYWluLXNreS1wbGF0Zm9ybS1wcm9kdWN0aW9uLTIuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Surging oil prices have been driving Ether selling pressure: Tom Lee\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Fundstrat's Tom Lee pointed out an inverse correlation between crude and Ether as oil surged back to around $110 on Monday. \n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9vaWwtYml0Y29pbi1jb2luLWFudC1ibG9ja2NoYWluLXNreS1wbGF0Zm9ybS1wcm9kdWN0aW9uLTIuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9vaWwtYml0Y29pbi1jb2luLWFudC1ibG9ja2NoYWluLXNreS1wbGF0Zm9ybS1wcm9kdWN0aW9uLTIuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Reports suggest Iran is mulling Hormuz ‘insurance’ scheme, paid in Bitcoin</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 06:53:38 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 06:53:38 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/iran-mulls-platform-for-ships-transiting-strait-of-hormuz-to-pay-in-bitcoin-report</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/iran-mulls-platform-for-ships-transiting-strait-of-hormuz-to-pay-in-bitcoin-report?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9ob3JtdXotc3RyYWl0LmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Reports suggest Iran is mulling Hormuz ‘insurance’ scheme, paid in Bitcoin\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Screenshots of a website called “Hormuz Safe” have been circulating on social media, which offers “digital insurance” for ships passing through the Strait of Hormuz.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9ob3JtdXotc3RyYWl0LmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9ob3JtdXotc3RyYWl0LmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Senate crypto bill at risk beyond midterms if not passed by August: NYDIG</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:23:11 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:23:11 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/senate-crypto-bill-august-advance-in-lame-duck-session-nydig</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/senate-crypto-bill-august-advance-in-lame-duck-session-nydig?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1hLXN0ZXAtdG93YXJkcy1iZXR0ZXItZ292ZXJubWVudC11c2luZy1jcnlwdG8tMS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Senate crypto bill at risk beyond midterms if not passed by August: NYDIG\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>NYDIG’s Greg Cipolaro says the Senate’s crypto market structure bill is at risk of failing if it cannot clear a floor vote by August.\n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Jesse Coghlan</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1hLXN0ZXAtdG93YXJkcy1iZXR0ZXItZ292ZXJubWVudC11c2luZy1jcnlwdG8tMS5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1hLXN0ZXAtdG93YXJkcy1iZXR0ZXItZ292ZXJubWVudC11c2luZy1jcnlwdG8tMS5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Analysts debate whether Bitcoin is in ‘sell in May’ bear market setup</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:06:21 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:06:21 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/sell-in-may-historical-pattern-could-see-btc-back-at-33k-analyst</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/sell-in-may-historical-pattern-could-see-btc-back-at-33k-analyst?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9lb3NldGhlcmV1bW1hcmtldGZhbGxiaWd3YXZlLW5ldy5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Analysts debate whether Bitcoin is in ‘sell in May’ bear market setup\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Some analysts argue that a comparatively broadened, institutionalized buyer base for crypto today may prevent a repeat of the drawdowns seen in May 2018 and May 2022. </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9lb3NldGhlcmV1bW1hcmtldGZhbGxiaWd3YXZlLW5ldy5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9lb3NldGhlcmV1bW1hcmtldGZhbGxiaWd3YXZlLW5ldy5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>WETH markets return to normal operations on Aave amid rsETH recovery progress</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:02:08 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:02:08 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/aave-restores-weth-borrowing-after-kelp-dao-rseth-exploit</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/aave-restores-weth-borrowing-after-kelp-dao-rseth-exploit?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wYXNzd29yZC1mcmF1ZC1oYWNrZXItc2NhbTQuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"WETH markets return to normal operations on Aave amid rsETH recovery progress\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Aave applied a temporary freeze to WETH as a precautionary safety measure in response to the Kelp DAO exploit, alongside freezes on the rsETH and wrsETH reserves. </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wYXNzd29yZC1mcmF1ZC1oYWNrZXItc2NhbTQuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wYXNzd29yZC1mcmF1ZC1oYWNrZXItc2NhbTQuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Grayscale, VanEck amend US spot BNB ETF filings, stepping closer to potential launch</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 02:40:22 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 02:40:22 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-vaneck-advance-bnb-etf-filings-for-potential-sec-approval</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-vaneck-advance-bnb-etf-filings-for-potential-sec-approval?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1rLWxhdW5jaC1mdW5kaW5nLWZvci1jb3VydC1jYXNlLXZzLXNlYy0yLWV0Zi5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Grayscale, VanEck amend US spot BNB ETF filings, stepping closer to potential launch\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The US securities regulator approved 21Shares’ Hyperliquid ETF last week, adding to a growing number of cryptocurrencies converted into ETF wrappers in the US.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1rLWxhdW5jaC1mdW5kaW5nLWZvci1jb3VydC1jYXNlLXZzLXNlYy0yLWV0Zi5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1rLWxhdW5jaC1mdW5kaW5nLWZvci1jb3VydC1jYXNlLXZzLXNlYy0yLWV0Zi5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Here’s what happened in crypto today</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 17 May 2026 22:30:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-hap