  <link>https://decrypt.co/367943/thorchains-rune-token-plunges-double-digits-after-10m-exploit-trading-halt</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 10:58:24 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The liquidity protocol halted operations after blockchain researchers identified a suspected $10 million breach across multiple networks.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367943</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Hacker-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>thorchain</category>\n    \n      <category>DeFi</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Hacker-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenAI Pushes New ChatGPT Safety Features as Lawsuits Mount</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367937/openai-new-chatgpt-safety-features-lawsuits-investigations</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 21:43:50 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>OpenAI says ChatGPT can better detect signs of self-harm and violence as the company faces lawsuits and investigations over dangerous chatbot interactions.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367937</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-openai-logo-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-openai-logo-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Apple Mac M5 System Exploited With Anthropic&#39;s Claude Mythos AI, Researchers Claim</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367925/apple-mac-m5-system-exploited-anthropic-claude-mythos-ai</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 21:16:53 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Security startup Calif says researchers used a preview version of Anthropic&#39;s Claude Mythos AI to help build an Apple macOS kernel exploit.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367925</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/apple-logo-decrypy-style-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/apple-logo-decrypy-style-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>NFL All Day Stops Issuing NFTs as Dapper Labs Signals Future Plans With League</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367926/nfl-all-day-stops-issuing-nfts-dapper-labs-future-plans-league</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 21:04:00 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Dapper Labs said it has signed a new licensing agreement with the NFL as it discontinues the release of NFTs on its All Day platform.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367926</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-nfl-football-gID_7.png@png\" len