an-s-sbi-securities-rakuten-securities-plan-to-offer-crypto-investment-trusts</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/513f15ff40f6e6e9caf1a75ebe728c61199e91e1-997x577.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">db6832c1-0b31-4a48-bede-a4d7d1b3c27f</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 11:41:31 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Another 11 companies responded to a survey saying they would consider offering crypto funds once the regulatory environment becomes clear.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Sheldon Reback</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business\"><![CDATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Japan]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[ETFs]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[A Russian stablecoin built to dodge sanctions says it can survive even if they're lifted]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/24/a-russian-stablecoin-built-to-dodge-sanctions-says-it-can-survive-even-if-they-re-lifted</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/0522bac88865161da0044016661f4490ea9d1002-1920x1080.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">23348742-aeae-43f8-afdb-13d2e7d707af</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[ A7A5, the Russia-linked stablecoin built to move money around banking restrictions, says faster trade settlement, yield and regional crypto infrastructure could keep it relevant even if geopolitical tensions ease. ]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Sam Reynolds</dc:creator>\n    